sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]
    App->>Node: GapCentral.RemoveAllBonds()
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(0)
    Note over App: Removes all stored bonds. The callback always reports 0<br>as the final bond count, regardless of the previous state.
